 "warnings": [
  {
   "code": "printed-value-not-quantity-times-rate",
   "detail": "15 of 41 row(s) print a value that is not their own quantity x rate — e.g. AXIS BANK EQ at 7300 x 1368.25 = 9988225.00 against a printed 2133101.75. The printed column sums to the printed total exactly and still implies impossible prices, so market value is DERIVED and the printed figure is kept only as the check."
  },
  {
   "code": "aif-units-carry-face-value-not-nav",
   "detail": "13 AIF holding(s) are carried with units and NO market value, because the rate this statement prints for them is the FACE VALUE the units were issued at rather than a NAV — 3P India Equity Fund 1 — Class B3 (1416918.692 units at a face value of 100); BAVF Series 20 — Class C6 (856.736 units at a face value of —); Buoyant Opportunities Strategy — Class A4 (1918953.2 units at a face value of 100); …. Where the fund itself issues a statement in this book, that is where the valuation comes from."
  },
  {
   "code": "no-rate-published",
   "detail": "the depository prints no rate for 5 holding(s) — ABSL BAL ADV-GROWTH (INF084M01AB8), CHEELIZZA IND-EQ1/- (INE0MSX01027), CLEAN MAX ENV-EQ 1/- (INE647U01026), MIRAE LCF D-GROW (INF769K01AX2), …. A rate of 0.000 is read as NOT PRICED, never as a price of zero, so these carry units and no market value."
  },
  {
   "code": "field-not-in-document-contract",
   "detail": "Motilal Oswal Financial Services (demat) returned printedTotalValuation, which makeDocument does not carry — the value is discarded. Add it to lib/document.mjs."
  }
